# Root-level environment file template.
# Application-specific variables are documented in each app's .env.example.
# Never put real credentials in this file or commit a populated .env.
# Backend: backend/.env.example
# Admin web: admin-web/.env.example
# Employee app: employee-app-temp/.env.example
# QR display: qr-display/.env.example
# Docker deployment: deploy/load-balancer/.env.docker.example
